          "text": " yaabagira ati: Muri abakuru b'amaju ga baashwenkuriimwe Abaleevi; mweyeze, imwe ana beene waanyu, mubone kwinamura eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli kugita omu mwanya ogu ngibonereize. ",
