        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba obw'okubanza timuragiheekire, nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaatugwereireho naatutura okutagitwaza, nk'oku kyaragiirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
