              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baayeyeza ahabw'okuza kwinamura eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
