          "text": " Batyo Abaleevi baatoorana Hemani mwene Yoeli, omuri beene ishe baatoorana Asafu mwene Berekia, n'omuri beene Merari baatoorana Esaani mwene Kushaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
