        {
          "text": " Shebania, Yoshafaati, Netaneeli, Amasai, Zekaria, Benaaya na Eliezeeri, abanyamurwa, nibo baabaire bari ab'okugyenda nibateerera amakondere omu maisho g'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga; Obededomu na Yehia nabo bari abakumiirizi b'eirembo ahabw'eshanduukye.",
